{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clock in for work, check out from sanity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time you will be the only one working the <strong>Night Shift</strong>, your coworker who was supposed to join you never showed up.\u00a0Your job is to pack boxes, label them and keep the warehouse running until the morning. It's simple, you've done it a million times, nothing can go <strong>wrong</strong>...or <strong>can</strong> it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/b834ca95b28374e27250c92ed3a92381.poster.avif?t=1762099669\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/b834ca95b28374e27250c92ed3a92381.webm?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform real warehouse work collect products, pack boxes, label them, and load pallets with the forklift. Every action is <strong>hands-on</strong> and physics-driven, creating a strangely <strong>satisfying</strong> sensation of managing the warehouse on your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the night drags on, things start to change. And the line between your work and your memories begins to dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.poster.avif?t=1762099669\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.webm?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.mp4?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Shift</strong> isn\u2019t just about surviving the dark it\u2019s about questioning what\u2019s real. Explore detailed, <strong>realistic environments</strong> where your surroundings twist between the familiar and the impossible, and where every noise could be a memory calling back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/24194b3560efd5bebf26b954b12dfb5c.poster.avif?t=1762099669\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/24194b3560efd5bebf26b954b12dfb5c.webm?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features section</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands-on, physics-based interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn psychological horror with immersive atmosphere </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic environments that blur the line between regular and nightmare </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven exploration and surreal transitions between memories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claustrophobic and tension-filled sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive one night shift when reality itself breaks down ?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508480?t=1762099669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508480?t=1762099669","c