 <strong>satisfying</strong> sensation of managing the warehouse on your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the night drags on, things start to change. And the line between your work and your memories begins to dissolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.poster.avif?t=1762099669\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.webm?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/dbb0c38728831e693ca5f93e306d71db.mp4?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Shift</strong> isn\u2019t just about surviving the dark it\u2019s about questioning what\u2019s real. Explore detailed, <strong>realistic environments</strong> where your surroundings twist between the familiar and the impossible, and where every noise could be a memory calling back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/24194b3560efd5bebf26b954b12dfb5c.poster.avif?t=1762099669\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508480/extras/24194b3560efd5bebf26b954b12dfb5c.webm?t=1762099669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features section</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands-on, physics-based interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-burn psychological h